        <head>CURED IN THREE DAYS BY CU ricußA OINTMENT</head>
        <p>CURED IN THREE DAYS BY CU ricußA OINTMENT</p>
        <p>'My little son's eczema started when he was seven weeks old, his head, face, shoulders, neck. and arms suddenly be- coming red and rough, -- just the way one's hands turn if one dab- ') . bles in water a great 4, deal. A doctor saw Illki4l it was eczema, and ISL did his best for six months, without avail. The child's condition . jwent from bad toworse, the affected parts be- coming one solid sore. Vigil rug He was a pitiable sight, bellf crying nearly all the Op time and quite ex- _ hatzSting himself in his efforts to allay his torturing skin by rubbing and scratch- ing. We were almost despairing, think- ing it meant either death or lifelong suffering, but Cuticura Ointment was at last applied, and within a few hours Mrs. Cooper said she noticed a change for the better. After three days' treat- ment it was quite apparent that a com- plete cure had been effected. In a week his skin was perfectly clear. Really, I should never have believed it if I had not seen it myself. This was two years ago and my child has never had the slightest return of any skin irritation, and is now the perfect picture of health. I cannot too strongly expross my gratitude for what the wonderful Cuticura has done for us. I am only too pleased to show the child to any one who calls to verify this marvellous cure. William Cooper, 246, Murchison Rd., Leyton, London, N. E. July 4, 1907." Send to nearest depot for free Cuti- curaßook on Treatmentof Skin Diseases..</p>
