        <p>an explanation of that kind. (Laughter.) I was deal- ing with the present time. TREAT TO THE INMATES. Miss Bessie Dutton wrote that the Ladies' Visiting Committee desired to give their annual trAat to the inmates on February 4th and the proceedings would take the form of a tea and concert. The Board granted permission. NUMBER or INMATES. Mr. Spruce reported that the number of inmates in the [louse was 174 as compared With 175 on the cor- responding date last year.</p>
