        <p>OUGHT -I TO USE GLASSES.--in order to answer this question it is necessary to test the sight. This is done and all information given willingly. JotiNsToN WATSON, Eyesight Testing Rooms, 84, 13r1dge-street, Warrington. Hours of Business: 9.30 to 7.30. Johnston Watson attends on Monday and Tuesday from 11 to 4.30, Wednesday 11 to 5.30. Thurday 11 to 1, and Friday and Saturday 11 to s.3o.—Advt.</p>
