      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1909-01-23_WidnesExaminer_art0091" n="art0091">
        <head>AE4IU 'lBll wh V</head>
        <p>AE4IU 'lBll wh V</p>
        <p>your Liniment has cured where lots of others</p>
        <p>failed."</p>
        <p>"Thank you very much for your Liniment. It has relieved me from many an hour's pain. I consider it to be- the best liniment on the market for Rheumatism, and shall recommend it to all my friends. I have suffered a great deal these last two years with Rheumatism, hut now I am pleased to say lain better, for it has cured me where lots of other liniments have failed. I have no other cure but Sloan's wonderful Liniment. You may use this letter as you like, as everybody ought to know the value of Dr. Sloan's Liniment." Jss. BESWICK, 20 Dolland Street, off 11loston Lane, Manchester.</p>
      </div>
