        <p>is the most penetrating of liniments.</p>
        <p>' Wherever the pain may be—in muscles, organs, tissues, or joints—Sloan's Liniment will reach it and stop it at once. There is absolutely nothing to equal Sloan's Liniment. You feel its warm and comforting relief immediately you apply it, and it's so pene- trating that there's no need to rub it in. Sold in I/1i bottles at all Chemists. amp. Write for a copy of Dr. Sloan's Emergency g.". Book, which tells you how to treat Rheumatism successfully, and also gives many valuable hints on what to do in painful emer- gencies. It will be sent you Free.</p>
