        <p>WARRINGTON CLUB. On Saturday the tenth competition for the club prize was played. H. H. Evans qualified in the first division with 7 down to bogey. O. Lofthouse and B. S. Newcombe tied in the second division with 9 down and will play off next Saturday. Scores : FIRST DIVISIoN. fT. Evans 5 ... 7 down H. G. Roberts 6 9 down L. Voisey 5 ... 12 down C. 0. Stone 5 ... 12 down R. M. Roberts 6 ... 12 down J. Ellison 7 ... 12 down 1 I 'ca p. Net. SECOND DIVISION. }reap. Net. 0. Lofthouse B. S. Newcombe E. J. Hall W. Richardscn, jun l2 ... 14 down</p>
